    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34506" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπρεπής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>conspicuous among</i> or
				<i>above</i> others, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύννος . . πᾶσιν ἰχθύεσσιν ἐ. ἐν
					μυττωτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anan.
					5.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>conspicuous for</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰηλέμοισιν
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				115
			</span></i> (lyr.); cf.sq. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>suitable, fitting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.501
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπρεπές ἐστι</span>, c.
				inf., it is <i>fitting</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				435
			</span></i>, al.: 
				Comp.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				617
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				695
			</span></i>.</div>
